{#
Generated by: Claude Code CLI
Date time: 2026/09/06 18:00 SAST
Version: 0.6
Description:
  The shared sortable column heading for every list that offers sorting.

  One control, parameterised by the header model the service builds, exactly as the shared search
  and pagination controls are. A list gets sortable columns by rendering this instead of a plain
  heading; it never builds a sort link of its own, because a link that rebuilt its own URL would be
  free to drop the search term or the data universe that the paging links keep.

  Sorting is one column at a time. The heading in force shows its direction; every other heading
  offers the direction that column reads best when it is first applied, so a date opens newest
  first and a name opens A to Z rather than making the reader click twice to find out.

  htmx swaps the results region exactly as paging does, and each heading is an ordinary link
  underneath, so sorting works with no JavaScript at all.

  WARNING: a template comment is not a safe place to document syntax. A comment delimiter
  written inside a comment body ends the comment early and leaks the remainder onto the page.
  Keep every comment plain prose: no comment delimiters and no code, not even to document one.
Changelog:
  2026/09/08 13:00 SAST
  - Carries the column's share of the table width, so the proportions live beside the labels.
  2026/09/07 09:00 SAST
  - Renders an ordinary heading for a column the dataset cannot sort by, so one repeat draws a whole header row and a column can gain sorting without its markup changing.
  2026/09/06 18:00 SAST
  - Created for the v0.6 sortable list columns.
#}
{#
	The attributes are written as literal markup with only their values interpolated. Built as a
	string - style="width:NN%" produced by an expression - Twig autoescapes the quotes, and the
	browser receives style=&quot;width:26%&quot; as text. Every column width on every table was
	inert for exactly that reason.
#}
{% if sh.sortable %}
	<th class="sortable-header {{ sh.active ? 'is-sorted' : '' }}"
	    {% if sh.width %}style="width:{{ sh.width }}%"{% endif %}
	    {% if sh.active %}aria-sort="{{ sh.direction == 'desc' ? 'descending' : 'ascending' }}"{% endif %}>
		<a href="{{ sh.href }}"
			   hx-get="{{ sh.href }}" hx-target="#{{ sort_region }}" hx-select="#{{ sort_results }}"
			   hx-swap="innerHTML" hx-push-url="true" hx-indicator="closest .table-wrap">
		{{ sh.label }}<span class="sortable-indicator" aria-hidden="true">{{ sh.active ? (sh.direction == 'desc' ? '▼' : '▲') : '↕' }}</span>
		</a>
	</th>
{% else %}
	<th {% if sh.width %}style="width:{{ sh.width }}%"{% endif %}>
		{{ sh.label }}
	</th>
{% endif %}
